{:edb/db-before-t 496 :edb/db-after-t 497 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533809 50 #inst "2026-10-05T02:18:24.571Z" 13194139533809 true] [17592186100740 1020 #edb/ref 17592186252812 13194139533809 true] [17592186100740 1020 #edb/ref 17592186252819 13194139533809 true] [17592186100741 1020 #edb/ref 17592186252805 13194139533809 true] [17592186100741 1020 #edb/ref 17592186252826 13194139533809 true] [17592186100833 1020 #edb/ref 17592186252816 13194139533809 true] [17592186252805 1017 #edb/ref 17592186252806 13194139533809 true] [17592186252805 1089 "q-105493" 13194139533809 true] [17592186252805 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533809 true] [17592186252805 1100 "The values of functions $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ and their derivatives at $x=0$ are given in the table below.\n\n| $x$ | $f(x)$ | $g(x)$ | ${f}^{′}(x)$ | ${g}^{′}(x)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $0$ | $3$ | $1$ | $0$ | $2$ |\n\nIf $h(x)=\\frac{3f(x)-1}{2g(x)+2},$ determine the value of ${h}^{′}(0).$" 13194139533809 true] [17592186252805 1113 #uuid "c14bafb6-deba-59e6-83ba-5f1bd4461fa4" 13194139533809 true] [17592186252805 1145 "The quotient rule states that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{u}{v})=\\frac{v{u}^{′}-u{v}^{′}}{{v}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nLet $u=3f(x)-1$ and $v=2g(x)+2.$ Differentiating each, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3{f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{and}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=2{g}^{′}(x).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the quotient rule gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{v{u}^{′}-u{v}^{′}}{{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2g(x)+2)\\cdot 3{f}^{′}(x)-(3f(x)-1)\\cdot 2{g}^{′}(x)}{(2g(x)+2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3{f}^{′}(x)(2g(x)+2)-2{g}^{′}(x)(3f(x)-1)}{(2g(x)+2)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt $x=0$, this gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{′}(0) & =\\frac{3{f}^{′}(0)(2g(0)+2)-2{g}^{′}(0)(3f(0)-1)}{(2g(0)+2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot 0\\cdot (2\\cdot 1+2)-2\\cdot 2\\cdot (3\\cdot 3-1)}{(2\\cdot 1+2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4\\cdot 8}{{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194